n>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t value of</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
